{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/337522b8331ad754fdf46d0c4d941a6c.avif?t=1759240124\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Testimonium is a very short, experimental and linear game designed to be completed in a single sitting (15 minutes). There is no save system and minimal replay value. It can be played for FREE or donated to on Itch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one escapes Hell. <strong>Not truly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.poster.avif?t=1759240124\" width=400 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.webm?t=1759240124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.mp4?t=1759240124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He thought it was just another Jehovah\u2019s Witness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when he opened the door, there was no one. Just a package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside: a VHS tape. No label. Just a symbol burned into the plastic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He played it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/b628c5d0685469c27cddb22164dd978b.avif?t=1759240124\" width=1000 height=562 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testimonium is a short analog horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside the tape \u2014 a rusted iron maiden, blood-soaked rituals, rooms bound to sin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no escape. Only the loop. Only the delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins in a shitty apartment ends in a place far below \u2014 again and again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crunchy 90s Art Direction.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsettling Atmosphere.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Minutes of Gameplay.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953690?t=1759240124","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953690?t=1759240124","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/0949cf2f86917a14e3f4fcf32f43c03ecf931348/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759240124","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/0949cf2f86917a14e3f4fcf32f43c03ecf931348/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759240124","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Testimonium contains scenes of violence and horror."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/337522b8331ad754fdf46d0c4d941a6c.avif?t=1759240124\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Testimonium is a very short, experimental and linear game designed to be completed in a single sitting (15 minutes). There is no save system and minimal replay value. It can be played for FREE or donated to on Itch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one escapes Hell. <strong>Not truly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.poster.avif?t=1759240124\" width=400 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.webm?t=1759240124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.mp4?t=1759240124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He thought it was just another Jehovah\u2019s Witness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when he opened the door, there was no one. Just a package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside: a VHS tape. No label. Just a symbol burned into the plastic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He played it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/b628c5d0685469c27cddb22164dd978b.avif?t=1759240124\" width=1000 height=562 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testimonium is a short analog horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside the tape \u2014 a rusted iron maiden, blood-soaked rituals, rooms bound to sin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no escape. Only the loop. Only the delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins in a shitty apartment ends in a place far below \u2014 again and again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crunchy 90s Art Direction.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsettling Atmosphere.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Minutes of Gameplay.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Andrii Sotnyk"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/333339b791d1d83e3bb72a3bce6457509704c292/header.jpg?t=1759240124","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3953690/1278492165/6d1f5d5c1f045f07ad611b7785c826cd63a27c9d/1755083934/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759240016","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3953690/1278492165/6d1f5d5c1f045f07ad611b7785c826cd63a27c9d/1755083934/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759240016","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3953690/1278492165/6d1f5d5c1f045f07ad611b7785c826cd63a27c9d/1755083934/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759240016","id":257182573,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257182573/movie480.mp4?t=1759240016","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257182573/movie_max.mp4?t=1759240016"},"name":"Reveal Trailer v1.1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182573/13a54980589e2b2371a9a891383aa6d0dd1263da/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759240016","webm":{"480":"https://video